{"3886430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wade: Fly Fishing", "steam_appid": 3886430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4802480], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/6f2fcf91c1cd10608c716d592adeeed6.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/6f2fcf91c1cd10608c716d592adeeed6.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/6f2fcf91c1cd10608c716d592adeeed6.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The only realistic fly fishing simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wade is a realistic fly fishing simulation with line and rod physic as close as possible from real life. It will feels like you are on a river far from everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a8b74fb67430f48509d900413fbf1409.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a8b74fb67430f48509d900413fbf1409.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a8b74fb67430f48509d900413fbf1409.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the river</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river currents are carefully crafted to mimic what you would see, practice your cast, mend your line to keep your fly alive and not drifting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a6788d65e2a6f7c497579be13563be44.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a6788d65e2a6f7c497579be13563be44.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a6788d65e2a6f7c497579be13563be44.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrill of the fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know this adrenaline rush when a fish bite your fly? Stay focus, keep a good tension on your line, drop your rod when the fish jumps. And catch incredible clear water fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/3ed5799ace5b22e6649332ab6776f9fb.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/3ed5799ace5b22e6649332ab6776f9fb.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/3ed5799ace5b22e6649332ab6776f9fb.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/0e4a11406d3d512030039b73b5319364.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/0e4a11406d3d512030039b73b5319364.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/0e4a11406d3d512030039b73b5319364.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more coming:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fish species with their own difficulty and fight behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full hand control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spey rod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivers from all around the world</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/6f2fcf91c1cd10608c716d592adeeed6.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/6f2fcf91c1cd10608c716d592adeeed6.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/6f2fcf91c1cd10608c716d592adeeed6.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The only realistic fly fishing simulation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wade is a realistic fly fishing simulation with line and rod physic as close as possible from real life. It will feels like you are on a river far from everything else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a8b74fb67430f48509d900413fbf1409.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a8b74fb67430f48509d900413fbf1409.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a8b74fb67430f48509d900413fbf1409.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the river</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The river currents are carefully crafted to mimic what you would see, practice your cast, mend your line to keep your fly alive and not drifting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a6788d65e2a6f7c497579be13563be44.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a6788d65e2a6f7c497579be13563be44.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/a6788d65e2a6f7c497579be13563be44.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Thrill of the fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know this adrenaline rush when a fish bite your fly? Stay focus, keep a good tension on your line, drop your rod when the fish jumps. And catch incredible clear water fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/3ed5799ace5b22e6649332ab6776f9fb.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/3ed5799ace5b22e6649332ab6776f9fb.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/3ed5799ace5b22e6649332ab6776f9fb.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/0e4a11406d3d512030039b73b5319364.poster.avif?t=1784905607\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/0e4a11406d3d512030039b73b5319364.webm?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/extras/0e4a11406d3d512030039b73b5319364.mp4?t=1784905607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And so much more coming:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different fish species with their own difficulty and fight behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full hand control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spey rod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rivers from all around the world</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Step into a Quebec river and fly fish in VR. Hand-crafted rod and line physics, living currents, and fish fights that demand real focus, hook it, fight it, and try not to lose it.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/91516b7a6ed74d749809025791d32ebfcee30238/header.jpg?t=1784905607", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/94c6ce599dde794116b92637b19571ec58ffb0fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784905607", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886430/94c6ce599dde794116b92637b19571ec58ffb0fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784905607", "website": "https://josquinz.github.io/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<